<title>USA: Worldcom chairmam Crowe resigns.</title>
<headline>Worldcom chairmam Crowe resigns.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>WorldCom Inc said Monday that James Crowe, who has announced he plans to join Kiewit Diversified Group as president and chief executive officer, has resigned as chairman and director of WorldCom.</p>
<p>WorldCom also said that Walter Scott, chairman of Peter Kiewit Sons' Inc is resigning from the WorldCom board for personal reasons.  Peter Kiewit is the parent of Kiewit Diversified.</p>
<p>Scott intends to keep his WorldCom stockholdings and to remain a major shareholder in the company, WorldCom said.</p>
<p>WorldCom is a global business telecommunications company.</p>
</text>
